    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="2">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Iudex">Iudex</ref> 2</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Sume gyltas beoð fram þam godan deman þurh riht to betanne, sume þurh mildheortnesse tó forgyfanne.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">The good judge corrects some faults in a strict manner; others [are corrected] with merciful forgiveness.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Quedam culpe reputantur a bonis iudicibus secundum rectum emendande, quedam per Dei misericordiam condonande.</ab>
      </div>
